# Purpose

This document defines the validation engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to ensure all information entering the platform is verified according to business rules, architectural boundaries, and trust requirements before becoming part of the trusted domain.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Validation philosophy
* Trust boundaries
* Business validation
* Data integrity
* Validation consistency
* Validation governance

It intentionally excludes validation libraries, framework-specific implementations, user interface behavior, and language-specific techniques, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to validation, ensuring business integrity is preserved through explicit verification rather than implicit assumptions.

